Z||000010||Patrick||01-27-2000||02:38 AM||||<BR><B>Steve</B>, please don't think that I was ticked off about your post. It was actually kind of a cute story. You're relatively new here and you probably don't know the personalities of the members yet, but I was  just being rather facetious with my comments. Having said all that, I still think we should keep to ourselves what a fun car the Fiero is. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||14
Z||000011||WKDFIRO||01-27-2000||03:09 AM||||Im glad you had as much fun reading it as I had writing it, Rick. And if the message was lost somewhere in the translation...Good work Steve!<P>I agree with you 110% Shiner. I LIVE for those guys in Civic who think, "Just another Fiero..." Then to have my Fiero lay down 2 glorious smoke filled tire marks at the light. Little boys and their little toys...I love giving them a lesson in Sleeper 101.||||reg||6
