Z||000016||Cooter||01-27-2000||04:15 PM||||Even though I have a Civic, I know that it is not a hot rod. However, I REALLY ENJOY spanking those ricer kids with their slammed, coffee can equipped later model civics. They think those cut springs and goofy wheels make their base level car a performance sedan. Mine is an Si (with the Si emblems removed)with no cat, mallary ignition box and I threw the intake muffler/restriction away. It makes those guys so mad because their sporty looking coupes just got smoked by a stock looking hatchback. Now, if I could just afford that 50 horse nitrous kit. . .||||reg||1
